'''''Gymnostomum''''' is a genus of [[bryophyte]] in family [[Pottiaceae]].<ref>Buck, William R. & Bernard Goffinet. 2000. "Morphology and classification of mosses", pages 71-123 ''in'' A. Jonathan Shaw & Bernard Goffinet (Eds.), ''Bryophyte Biology''. (Cambridge: Cambridge University Press). {{ISBN|0-521-66097-1}}.</ref> It was first described by [[Christian Gottfried Daniel Nees von Esenbeck]] and  [[Christian Friedrich Hornschuch]].<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.gbif.org/species/6008827|title=Gymnostomum Nees & Hornsch.|website=www.gbif.org|language=en|access-date=2020-03-17}}</ref>

